ue 210 in 1955. the family dog  in the l household crypto was used as a  test subject to send the rocket to earth  as carl's parents needed to make sure  they could land a rocket on the planet  with their son aboard unfortunately  crypto's rocket goes off course but the  ship eventually writes itself and kal-el  lands on earth and sends off a signal  just like his owner crypto has super  strength the power of flight x-ray  vision and freeze breath unfortunately  he'll be stripped of all these abilities  in the movie leaving him like every  other dog on the street this marks a  second dc project for johnson in 2022  who is set to debut as black adam on  october 21st johnson wrapped his  voiceover role in september 2021 and  said the animated film would be  incredible he's also lovingly nicknamed  his character bach kent the former  wrestlers production company seven bucks  production is also behind the film  the dwayne johnson kevin hart duo is  back as the latter joins dc league of  super pets as ace the baton ace is a  companion of you guessed it batman the  crime-fighting pub first appeared in  batman issue 92 in 1955.  much like crypto and the other pet  sidekicks in the cast ace debuted in the  original dc comics but is mostly known  for his time in the animated short  series dc super pets in the film ace  also boasts super dog strength which he  appears to have acquired when a lab he's  being held in is hit with a surge of  energy that comes from orange kryptonite  you're super strong i should be a lot  more dead right now right when promoting  dc league of super pets on his instagram  hart said he was excited to be back on  the big screen with his longtime  colleague johnson before the animated  film the actor starred in four films  together hobbs and shaw central  intelligence jumanji the next level and  jumanji welcome to the jungle johnson  revealed in a dc league of super bets  featurette that one of his favorite  things about the film is crypto and  ace's